This module enables Math::MPFR to overload arithmetic and comparison operations
with Math::GMP objects.
In such arithmetic operations a Math::MPFR object is returned.

REQUIREMENTS:
We require that at least version 4.35 of Math-MPFR is installed - otherwise
(not fully tested) the overloading might malfunction.
We also require that at least version 2.11 of Math::GMP is installed - otherwise
(not tested) the overloading might malfunction.
All meaningful tests in the test suite are skipped if the version of Math::MPFR
is less than 4.35, or if the version of Math::GMP is less than 2.11.
NOTE: It is up to the user (NOT the Math::GMP_OLOAD code) to ensure that both
      of those requirements are met.

Please file any bug reports at https://github.com/sisyphus/math-gmp_oload/Issues .
Pull Requests to https://github.com/sisyphus/math-gmp_oload/pulls are also welcome.

